      "content": "---\ntitle: \"Enchantment Extraction\"\nslug: \"enchantment-extraction\"\ntype: talent\nclassName: \"Artificer\"\nclassSlug: \"artificer\"\nclassCategory: \"Magical Classes\"\ntalentTier: \"Tier 3\"\ntier: \"Tier 3\"\nranks: 5\nprerequisite: \"Item Analysis Rank 2\"\ncost: \"1 Talent Point\"\ncooldown: \"Passive\"\nscaling: \"Extraction safety and quality improve by rank.\"\nsynergy: \"Feeds enchanting, crafting, item recovery, and rare material systems.\"\ntags:\n  - \"talent\"\n  - \"artificer\"\n  - \"tier-3\"\nvisibility: public\nsourceOrder: 12\n---\n\n# Enchantment Extraction\n\n## Overview\nExtraction safety and quality improve by rank.\n\n## Rank 1\nAttempt to extract simple enchantment traces from eligible items.\n\n## Rank 2\nImprove extraction stability and usable residue.\n\n## Rank 3\nRecover stronger enchantment patterns.\n\n## Rank 4\nExtract advanced enchantment components with lower risk.\n\n## Rank 5\nMaster high-grade enchantment extraction.\n\n## Prerequisites\nItem Analysis Rank 2\n\n## Scaling\nExtraction safety and quality improve by rank.\n\n## Synergy\nFeeds enchanting, crafting, item recovery, and rare material systems.\n\n## GM Notes\nInformation coming soon\n"
