      "slug": "lead-ingot",
      "title": "Lead Ingot",
      "category": "materials/1-common/metals/lead-ingot",
      "source": "materials/1-common/metals/lead-ingot/index.md",
      "content": "---\ntitle: Lead Ingot\nslug: lead-ingot\ntype: item\nkingdom: Material\nitem_class: Common\ncategory: Ingot\nsubcategory: Metal\nmaterial_type: Metal\nmaterial_form: Ingot\nmaterial_family: Lead\nsource_items:\n  - Lead Ore\nweight: 1.5kg\nweight_class: Heavy\ndurability: Moderate\nenchantment_affinity: \"5% (+0 dice)\"\nmarket_value: 8 Marks\ntags:\n  - items\n  - materials\n  - metal\n  - ingot\n  - common\nvisibility: public\n---\n\n# Lead Ingot\n\n## Effect\nLead Ingots are used to suppress and contain magical energy rather than enhance it.\n\n---\n\n## Crafting Use\n- Anti-magic items\n- Sealed containers\n- Cursed relics\n\n---\n\n## Material Traits\n- Heavy and dense  \n- Soft but stable  \n- Magic dampening  \n\n---\n\n## Enchantment Use\n- Reduces magical output  \n- Blocks magical effects  \n\n---\n\n## Crafting Source\n- Requires: 4x [[Lead Ore]]\n\n---\n\n## Quote\n*\"Silence, forged into matter.\"*\n"
