      "content": "---\ntitle: Outcast\ntype: origin\ncategory: Shadow Origin\nvisibility: public\ntags:\n  - origin\n  - exile\n  - survival\n---\n\n# Outcast\n\n## Overview\nOutcasts live with distance between themselves and the society that shaped them.\n\n## Background\nThey may be exiled, blamed, self-banished, or simply unable to belong where they began.\n\n## Story Hooks\n- False accusation\n- Hidden name\n- Settlement that will not forgive\n\n"
