      "slug": "survival",
      "title": "Survival",
      "category": "skills/non-combat-skills/survival-and-exploration/survival",
      "source": "skills/non-combat-skills/survival-and-exploration/survival/index.md",
      "content": "---\ntitle: \"Survival\"\nslug: \"survival\"\ntype: skill\ncategory: \"Non-Combat Skills\"\nsubcategory: \"Survival & Exploration\"\nprimary_stat: \"Wisdom\"\nsecondary_stat: \"Constitution\"\nskill_rank: Novice\ntraining_type: \"General Training\"\nvisibility: public\nsummary: \"Survival is an Asteria survival & exploration skill governed by Wisdom, with Constitution as its supporting characteristic.\"\ntags:\n  - \"skill\"\n  - \"non-combat-skills\"\n  - \"survival-and-exploration\"\n---\n\n# Survival\n\n## Overview\n\nSurvival is an Asteria survival & exploration skill governed by Wisdom, with Constitution as its supporting characteristic.\n\n**Primary Characteristic:** Wisdom  \n**Secondary Characteristic:** Constitution\n\n## Ranks\n\n| Skill Rank | Affinity Range | Rank Modifier |\n| --- | --- | ---: |\n| Novice | 01-09 | -2 |\n| Initiate | 10-24 | -1 |\n| Apprentice | 25-44 | 0 |\n| Journeyman | 45-69 | +1 |\n| Adept | 70-84 | +2 |\n| Master | 85-97 | +3 |\n| Grandmaster | 98-100 | +4 |\n\nDetailed techniques for Survival are coming soon.\n\n## Checks\n\nUse **Wisdom** as the primary characteristic and **Constitution** as the supporting characteristic when the GM calls for a Survival check.\n\n## Training\n\nTraining information coming soon.\n\n## Lore\n\nInformation coming soon.\n\n## GM Notes\n\nGM-only information coming soon.\n"
